[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11105.15, "timestamp": "03:05:05", "text": "7"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11116.55, "timestamp": "03:05:16", "text": "但我独自一人在屋顶上，这是第一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11118.309, "timestamp": "03:05:18", "text": "他们可能是你的下属。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11123.429, "timestamp": "03:05:23", "text": "科桑，你还在屋顶上吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11128.99, "timestamp": "03:05:28", "text": "嗯？哦，这辆M3"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11130.269, "timestamp": "03:05:30", "text": "马克，你刚才是这么说的吗？ 2"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11134.269, "timestamp": "03:05:34", "text": "楼梯没问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11135.55, "timestamp": "03:05:35", "text": "是的。楼梯没问题。绝对是顶尖的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11140.349, "timestamp": "03:05:40", "text": "楼梯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11142.95, "timestamp": "03:05:42", "text": "我已经扶一个人上楼了，但还有一个人没上去。"}]